{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ted's favorite number is equal to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/224b177b777cbcba2c70ff44835ee9cda8af4275.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1\\cdot{2007\\choose 1}+2\\cdot {2007\\choose 2}+3\\cdot {2007\\choose 3} + \\cdots + 2007\\cdot {2007 \\choose 2007}\\]\" width=\"474\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Find the remainder when Ted’s favorite number is divided by 25.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/1141389c1630dd0a0933dca84386c2ed36726707.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 0\\qquad \\text{(B) } 1\\qquad \\text{(C) } 2\\qquad \\text{(D) } 3\\qquad \\text{(E) } 4\\qquad \\text{(F) } 5\\qquad \\text{(G) } 6\\qquad \\text{(H) } 7\\qquad \\text{(I) } 8\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"615\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a7581fd64c436b7f0f55b6b66646d1aef8f6207d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(J) } 9\\qquad \\text{(K) } 10\\qquad \\text{(L) } 11\\qquad \\text{(M) } 12\\qquad \\text{(N) } 13\\qquad \\text{(O) } 14\\qquad \\text{(P) } 15\\qquad \\text{(Q) } 16\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"648\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/f/a6f1da56f09ed5e900bf021517e9dbfe9731b810.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(R) } 17\\qquad \\text{(S) } 18\\qquad \\text{(T) } 19\\qquad \\text{(U) } 20\\qquad \\text{(V) } 21\\qquad \\text{(W) } 22\\qquad \\text{(X) } 23\\qquad \\text{(Y) } 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"628\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f76042901077ae4d3a144f3b39f7d8e5631c6c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T = \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} i \\cdot \\binom{2007}{i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"153\" height=\"55\" />.  That means\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/0/1c0c5895278fabba51bd86584b23c2276358b9d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2T = 2 \\cdot \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} (i \\cdot \\binom{2007}{i}\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"53\" />\nWe know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1be887fc079b4dce3f0b7fa454207e6c7285c6e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{2007}{i} = \\binom{2007}{2007-i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"177\" height=\"53\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa3f1551d7f846da16f1a337aaac7539aed3bbe8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2T = \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} (i \\cdot \\binom{2007}{i}) + \\sum_{j=1}^{2007} (j \\cdot \\binom{2007}{2007-j})\\]\" width=\"348\" height=\"54\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b982dfafcc03c6acaa9de89f7123e7217f811fba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007-j= i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76df8428ce0fc7c3962b7e3145036bd966bef1a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i+j = 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/35350d9f788b04c7e7a3ada1cdeee25b6a3b6891.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2T = 2007 \\cdot \\sum_{i=0}^{2007} \\binom{2007}{i}\\]\" width=\"185\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/b/7db9426ac2b5070160176587f1fa6bdbed9a9475.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2T = 2007 \\cdot 2^{2007}\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/f/42ff432bc7e090d5ef1483a8e64a82fbf6101749.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[T = 2007 \\cdot 2^{2006}\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/8/02810f9bfe7b80bf52c2cda235dc1b6f14488804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{10} \\equiv -1 \\pmod{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"19\" />.  Using the properties of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modular_arithmetic\" title=\"Modular arithmetic\">modular arithmetic</a>, we can find the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/205765661eec3b826aa58f8bdd01385da15bc728.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[T \\equiv 2007 \\cdot 2^{2000} \\cdot 2^6 \\pmod{25}\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/3/0c3d97062eccb7288eb63e875bacdbe6e6250aa4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[T \\equiv 2007 \\cdot (2^{10})^{200} \\cdot 64 \\pmod{25}\\]\" width=\"266\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/b/c3b6e25f58a83b461949e7c527aa7518ccdde9e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[T \\equiv 7 \\cdot 1 \\cdot 14 \\pmod{25}\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddde70b1cf09ecc167b79ea4e73b538b76efeaaa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[T \\equiv 98 \\pmod{25}\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/9/0694dc960ab1c0dee8fd76f072017b17b6d63875.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[T \\equiv 23 \\pmod{25}\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />\nThe remainder when Ted’s favorite number is divided by 25 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/6/0f65d676e3ccc24c74bf57f1a8b06560b04717de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(X) } 23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Pr